    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "A/D MOVE  \xB7  W TAP/HOLD/DOUBLE JUMP  \xB7  S CROUCH  \xB7  R CLIMB\nSPACE
    DASH  \xB7  F DRONE (25 EN/BLOCK)  \xB7  T UNSTUCK\nSHIFT POWER  \xB7  LEFT FIRE 
    \xB7  RIGHT ARC  \xB7  Q SHIELD  \xB7  E WAVE\n\nTap W for a low jump; hold for
    a high jump. Release quickly and press again for the double jump.\n\nCarry two
    cyan cores to terminals per act. Protect each terminal until 100% and clear its
    attackers. Break the three relays and defeat the Act III guardian to open the
    final route.\n\nF deploys or recalls the drone: -25% movement, 25 energy per
    intercept, 8-second cooldown. LOW/HIGH grids pulse transparently while OPEN and
    block while LIVE."
